{"4804580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chill Chime Desktop", "steam_appid": 4804580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring the sounds of a Japanese summer to your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill Chime Desktop is a small desktop companion that displays a traditional Japanese wind chime and fills your workspace with the atmosphere of summer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the gentle ringing of wind chimes, the chorus of cicadas, evening insects, soft breezes, and other nostalgic sounds inspired by Japan's seasonal landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're working, studying, reading, or simply relaxing, let your desktop become a peaceful place where summer quietly drifts by.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Display a wind chime directly on your desktop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy relaxing summer-inspired ambient sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust sound volume to match your environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightweight design that runs quietly in the background</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for work, study, reading, and relaxation</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Small Piece of Summer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sound of a wind chime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warm breeze through an open window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The distant cry of cicadas on a summer afternoon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For many people, these sounds are memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill Chime Desktop brings a small piece of that summer to your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just a little summer, always within reach.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring the sounds of a Japanese summer to your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill Chime Desktop 